# Calculation engine

- Keep `backend/app/engine/` pure: explicit inputs and outputs, no database,
  network, filesystem, implicit clock or mutable global state.
- Use `Decimal` for money and shares, constructed from strings or integers,
  never floats.
- Reuse `backend/app/engine/rounding.py` and follow
  `docs/adr/0005-rounding-largest-remainder.md`: commercial cent rounding,
  largest-remainder distribution, deterministic ties and shares summing exactly
  to the total. Do not round intermediate values arbitrarily.
- Extend the existing golden tests in `backend/tests/engine/test_golden*.py`
  for changed calculations; include uneven shares and four-digit amounts.
